{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p (be aware of numerics).\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1 % p\n\n    result = 1\n    base = 2 % p\n    exponent = n\n\n    while exponent > 0:\n        if exponent % 2 == 1:\n            result = (result * base) % p\n        base = (base * base) % p\n        exponent //= 2\n    return result"}
